  "figureExecutionRules": "Preserve all type rules through planning, rendering and review. Visual judgement cannot certify numeric/statistical correctness. Typed data plots accept only JSON plans with plotStyle:{width:6..16,height:4..14,fontSize:10..20}; do not replace data or infer statistics.",
  "figureType": "状态转移图",
