  },
  "requirementsAuthority": "Original methodology, caption/visualIntent and avoidance constraints are authoritative. advisoryPlan and model/reference styling suggestions are not user requirements or proof of applied changes. Renderer limits do not cancel explicit user requirements: an unmet, unsupported or uncertain original requirement prevents a pass. Check actual current pixels/code for readability, clipping, overlap and ambiguous connections even when no original style was specified. Do not invent universal color, orientation or branch-position conventions.",
  "version": 1,
  "svgHash": "a90d806e5c10945c526929ee4647229e77d6731995a97933d99f959481fdd4ca",
  "pngHash": "958a8f1380342a4a4c9dea5166b9d316fa5654025349e8c27345b21438013865",
